IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-AUTODIN-NONCE-SEQ.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-AUTODIN-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME    PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-LN2-OVER-LNE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-AUTODIN-SESSION.
   05 D1-IS-FIRST-NONCE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-RANDOM-SEED-OK   PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-NONCE-TRACKER.
   05 D2-PREV-NONCE       PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-CURR-NONCE       PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-EXPECTED-NONCE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING     PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD    PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 693 TO D0-LN2-OVER-LNE.
    MOVE 5 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    
    comment Verify session initialization rule: First nonce must be random non-zero;
    IF D1-IS-FIRST-NONCE == 1
        IF D2-CURR-NONCE > 0 AND D1-RANDOM-SEED-OK == 1
            MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
            SET depth 4
        ELSE
            MOVE 1 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
            SET depth 1
        END-IF
    ELSE
        PERFORM VERIFY-LN2-LNE-NONCE-TRANSITION
        IF D2-CURR-NONCE == D2-EXPECTED-NONCE
            MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
            SET depth 4
        ELSE
            MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
            SET depth 1
        END-IF
    END-IF.
    
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

VERIFY-LN2-LNE-NONCE-TRANSITION.
    comment Derived progression: next_nonce = ((ln(2)/ln(e) * prev_nonce) / 1000) + ((31 * prev_nonce) / 32) + 1;
    COMPUTE D2-EXPECTED-NONCE = ((D0-LN2-OVER-LNE * D2-PREV-NONCE) / 1000) + ((31 * D2-PREV-NONCE) / 32) + 1.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-CURR-NONCE - ((D2-CURR-NONCE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
